OL,3,ATwelve killed in attack on airport in
OL,4,ASaudi capital Riyadh
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least 12 people have been killed and
OL,7,F309 injured in an attack on an
OL,8,Finternational airport in the Saudi
OL,9,Fcapital Riyadh, local authorities say,
OL,10,Fdays after Yemen's Houthis claimed to
OL,11,Fhave carried out similar strikes on the
OL,12,Fhub.
OL,14,FThe Saudi Civil Aviation Authority said
OL,15,Fthe victims were four Saudi and two
OL,16,FBangladeshi nationals, while Egypt,
OL,17,FJordan, Palestine, Sudan, Syria and the
OL,18,FUS each had one of their citizens
OL,19,Fkilled. Operations at King Khalid
OL,20,FInternational Airport in Riyadh have
OL,21,Fbeen suspended.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
