OL,3,ATwelve killed in attack on airport in
OL,4,ASaudi capital Riyadh
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than a dozen ambulances were seen
OL,7,Frushing to the airport, according to
OL,8,Fnews agency Reuters, citing an
OL,9,Feyewitness.
OL,11,FThe US embassy said it was "aware of
OL,12,Fattacks", urging Americans to avoid the
OL,13,Farea.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
